<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Imperialisme — Ekspansi Kekuasaan Dunia</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,300;9..144,450;9..144,600;9..144,700;9..144,900&family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,400;8..60,500;8..60,600&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --paper: #ECE2C8;
    --paper-deep: #DED0AC;
    --ink: #241C15;
    --ink-soft: #4A3F30;
    --indigo: #1C2B48;
    --indigo-deep: #101A2E;
    --gold: #B8862C;
    --gold-bright: #D9A741;
    --oxblood: #7A2E2A;
    --line: rgba(36,28,21,0.18);
    --paper-rgb: 236,226,200;
  }

  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}

  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}

  body{
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Source Serif 4', serif;
    font-size:17px;
    line-height:1.65;
    overflow-x:hidden;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(circle at 20% 10%, rgba(184,134,44,0.07), transparent 40%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 90% 80%, rgba(28,43,72,0.06), transparent 45%);
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{animation-duration:0.001ms !important; animation-iteration-count:1 !important; transition-duration:0.001ms !important; scroll-behavior:auto !important;}
  }

  ::selection{background:var(--gold); color:var(--indigo-deep);}

  h1,h2,h3,h4{font-family:'Fraunces', serif; font-weight:600; color:var(--indigo-deep); letter-spacing:-0.01em;}

  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'Space Mono', monospace;
    font-size:12px;
    letter-spacing:0.18em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--oxblood);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:10px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before{content:"";width:26px;height:1px;background:var(--oxblood);display:inline-block;}

  a{color:inherit;}

  /* ===== NAV ===== */
  .nav{
    position:fixed; top:0; left:0; right:0; z-index:100;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    padding:18px 5vw;
    background:rgba(var(--paper-rgb),0.86);
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    transition:padding 0.3s ease;
  }
  .nav-brand{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif; font-weight:700; font-size:18px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; color:var(--indigo-deep);
  }
  .nav-brand svg{width:22px;height:22px;}
  .nav-links{display:flex; gap:32px; list-style:none;}
  .nav-links a{
    font-family:'Space Mono', monospace; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.08em;
    text-transform:uppercase; text-decoration:none; color:var(--ink-soft);
    position:relative; padding-bottom:4px; transition:color 0.25s ease;
  }
  .nav-links a::after{
    content:""; position:absolute; left:0; bottom:0; width:0; height:1.5px;
    background:var(--oxblood); transition:width 0.3s ease;
  }
  .nav-links a:hover, .nav-links a.active{color:var(--oxblood);}
  .nav-links a:hover::after, .nav-links a.active::after{width:100%;}
  .nav-toggle{display:none; flex-direction:column; gap:5px; cursor:pointer; background:none; border:none;}
  .nav-toggle span{width:22px; height:2px; background:var(--ink);}

  /* ===== HERO ===== */
  .hero{
    min-height:100vh;
    display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    position:relative; text-align:center; padding:120px 6vw 80px;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero-compass{
    position:absolute; width:900px; height:900px; max-width:160vw;
    top:50%; left:50%; transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
    opacity:0.08; animation:spin 140s linear infinite; pointer-events:none;
  }
  @keyframes spin{from{transform:translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(0deg);} to{transform:translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(360deg);}}

  .hero-lat{
    font-family:'Space Mono', monospace; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.2em;
    color:var(--ink-soft); text-transform:uppercase; opacity:0.7; margin-bottom:22px;
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(52px, 10vw, 130px);
    line-height:0.92;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    max-width:1100px;
    position:relative;
    z-index:2;
  }
  .hero h1 em{
    font-style:italic; font-weight:300; color:var(--oxblood); display:block;
    font-size:0.42em; letter-spacing:0.02em; margin-top:6px;
  }
  .hero-sub{
    max-width:600px; margin-top:26px; font-size:19px; color:var(--ink-soft);
    position:relative; z-index:2;
  }
  .hero-etym{
    margin-top:44px; padding:18px 28px; border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.35); border-radius:2px;
    font-family:'Space Mono', monospace; font-size:13px; color:var(--ink);
    display:inline-flex; gap:14px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:center;
    position:relative; z-index:2;
  }
  .hero-etym b{color:var(--oxblood); font-style:italic;}
  .scroll-cue{
    position:absolute; bottom:38px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%);
    display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:8px;
    font-family:'Space Mono', monospace; font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.18em;
    color:var(--ink-soft); text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .scroll-cue .line{width:1px; height:36px; background:var(--ink-soft); position:relative; overflow:hidden;}
  .scroll-cue .line::after{
    content:""; position:absolute; top:-100%; left:0; width:100%; height:100%;
    background:var(--oxblood); animation:drip 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes drip{0%{top:-100%;} 60%{top:100%;} 100%{top:100%;}}

  /* ===== SECTION SHELL ===== */
  section{padding:120px 6vw; position:relative;}
  .section-head{max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 64px;}
  .section-head h2{font-size:clamp(34px,4.4vw,54px); margin-top:14px;}
  .section-head p{margin-top:16px; color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:18px; max-width:600px;}
  .wrap{max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto;}
  .reveal{opacity:0; transform:translateY(28px); transition:opacity 0.8s ease, transform 0.8s ease;}
  .reveal.in{opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);}

  /* ===== PENGERTIAN ===== */
  .define-grid{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr; gap:60px; align-items:start;
  }
  .define-text p{color:var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom:18px; font-size:17.5px;}
  .define-text strong{color:var(--indigo-deep);}
  .seal{
    width:56px; height:56px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--oxblood);
    color:var(--paper); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-weight:700; font-size:22px;
    flex-shrink:0; box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--paper), 0 0 0 4px var(--oxblood);
  }

  .compare-card{
    background:var(--indigo-deep); color:var(--paper); border-radius:6px;
    padding:36px 32px; position:relative; overflow:hidden;
  }
  .compare-card::before{
    content:""; position:absolute; inset:0;
    background-image:radial-gradient(circle at 80% 0%, rgba(217,167,65,0.18), transparent 55%);
  }
  .compare-row{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:20px; padding:20px 0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(236,226,200,0.14); position:relative; z-index:1;}
  .compare-row:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
  .compare-row .label{font-family:'Space Mono',monospace; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--gold-bright); margin-bottom:8px; display:block;}
  .compare-row p{font-size:14.5px; color:rgba(236,226,200,0.88); line-height:1.55;}
  .compare-title{font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:22px; margin-bottom:6px; position:relative; z-index:1;}
  .compare-sub{font-family:'Space Mono',monospace; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(236,226,200,0.55); margin-bottom:24px; position:relative; z-index:1;}

  /* ===== JENIS / ERA TABS ===== */
  .era-toggle{
    display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:0; margin-bottom:56px;
    border:1px solid var(--ink); width:fit-content; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto;
    border-radius:40px; overflow:hidden;
  }
  .era-toggle button{
    font-family:'Space Mono',monospace; font-size:12.5px; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase;
    padding:13px 28px; background:none; border:none; cursor:pointer; color:var(--ink);
    transition:all 0.3s ease;
  }
  .era-toggle button.active{background:var(--indigo-deep); color:var(--paper);}

  .era-panel{display:none;}
  .era-panel.active{display:block; animation:fadein 0.5s ease;}
  @keyframes fadein{from{opacity:0; transform:translateY(10px);} to{opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);}}

  .era-layout{display:grid; grid-template-columns:0.85fr 1.15fr; gap:56px; align-items:center;}
  .era-visual{
    aspect-ratio:1/1.05; border-radius:8px; position:relative; overflow:hidden;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  }
  .era-visual.kuno{background:linear-gradient(160deg, #C9972B, #7A2E2A 130%);}
  .era-visual.modern{background:linear-gradient(160deg, #1C2B48, #101A2E 130%);}
  .era-visual svg{width:58%; height:58%; opacity:0.92;}
  .era-visual .era-year{
    position:absolute; bottom:24px; left:24px; font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;
    color:rgba(236,226,200,0.85); font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase;
  }

  .era-copy .eyebrow{margin-bottom:16px;}
  .era-copy h3{font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,38px); margin-bottom:18px;}
  .era-copy p{color:var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom:16px;}
  .motto{
    display:flex; gap:14px; margin:24px 0; flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .motto span{
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-style:italic; font-size:19px; color:var(--oxblood);
    border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold); padding-bottom:2px;
  }
  .era-list{list-style:none; margin-top:18px;}
  .era-list li{
    padding:12px 0 12px 26px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); position:relative; color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:16px;
  }
  .era-list li::before{
    content:"→"; position:absolute; left:0; color:var(--oxblood); font-weight:700;
  }

  /* timeline */
  .timeline{
    margin-top:90px; position:relative; padding-top:60px;
  }
  .timeline::before{
    content:""; position:absolute; top:74px; left:0; right:0; height:2px;
    background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, var(--ink) 0 8px, transparent 8px 14px);
  }
  .timeline-track{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:20px;}
  .timeline-pt{position:relative; text-align:center;}
  .timeline-pt .dot{
    width:14px; height:14px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--paper); border:2.5px solid var(--oxblood);
    margin:0 auto 18px; position:relative; z-index:2;
  }
  .timeline-pt .yr{font-family:'Space Mono',monospace; font-size:12px; color:var(--oxblood); letter-spacing:0.06em; margin-bottom:6px;}
  .timeline-pt .desc{font-size:14.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); max-width:220px; margin:0 auto;}

  /* ===== CONTOH / CASE CARDS ===== */
  .case-grid{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:2px;}
  .case{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:220px 1fr; gap:40px;
    padding:44px 8px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); position:relative;
    transition:padding-left 0.4s ease;
  }
  .case:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .case:hover{padding-left:22px;}
  .case-flag{
    width:100%; aspect-ratio:4/5; border-radius:4px; position:relative; overflow:hidden;
    display:flex; align-items:flex-end; padding:16px;
  }
  .case-flag .yrs{font-family:'Space Mono',monospace; color:var(--paper); font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.08em; position:relative; z-index:1;}
  .case-flag::after{content:""; position:absolute; inset:0; background:linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 40%, rgba(0,0,0,0.45));}
  .case-flag.uk{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#1C2B48,#3C1E1E);}
  .case-flag.nl{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#7A2E2A,#B8862C);}
  .case-flag.us{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#101A2E,#1C2B48);}

  .case-body h4{font-size:24px; margin-bottom:6px;}
  .case-body .kicker{font-family:'Space Mono',monospace; font-size:11.5px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--oxblood); margin-bottom:12px; display:block;}
  .case-body p{color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:16.5px; max-width:640px;}
  .case-tags{display:flex; gap:10px; margin-top:18px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .case-tags span{
    font-family:'Space Mono',monospace; font-size:11px; padding:5px 12px; border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:20px; color:var(--ink-soft); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.04em;
  }

  /* ===== CLOSING ===== */
  .closing{
    background:var(--indigo-deep); color:var(--paper); text-align:center; padding:130px 6vw;
    position:relative; overflow:hidden;
  }
  .closing::before{
    content:""; position:absolute; inset:0;
    background-image:radial-gradient(circle at 15% 20%, rgba(184,134,44,0.14), transparent 45%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 85% 85%, rgba(122,46,42,0.18), transparent 45%);
  }
  .closing h2{color:var(--paper); font-size:clamp(30px,4.6vw,52px); max-width:820px; margin:0 auto; position:relative; z-index:1;}
  .closing p{color:rgba(236,226,200,0.7); max-width:600px; margin:22px auto 0; position:relative; z-index:1; font-size:17px;}

  footer{
    padding:34px 6vw; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;
    font-family:'Space Mono',monospace; font-size:11.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); letter-spacing:0.04em;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line); flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px;
  }

  @media (max-width:860px){
    .nav-links{
      position:fixed; top:60px; right:-100%; width:70%; height:calc(100vh - 60px);
      background:var(--paper); flex-direction:column; padding:40px 30px; gap:24px;
      transition:right 0.35s ease; border-left:1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .nav-links.open{right:0;}
    .nav-toggle{display:flex;}
    .define-grid, .era-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .timeline-track{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; row-gap:40px;}
    .case{grid-template-columns:110px 1fr; gap:20px; padding:30px 4px;}
    .case-body h4{font-size:20px;}
    section{padding:80px 5vw;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="nav">
  <div class="nav-brand">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 2 L14 12 L12 22 L10 12 Z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>
    Imperium
  </div>
  <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
    <li><a href="#beranda">Beranda</a></li>
    <li><a href="#pengertian">Pengertian</a></li>
    <li><a href="#jenis">Jenis</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contoh">Studi Kasus</a></li>
  </ul>
  <button class="nav-toggle" id="navToggle" aria-label="Buka menu"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
</nav>

<header class="hero" id="beranda">
  <svg class="hero-compass" viewBox="0 0 200 200">
    <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="98" fill="none" stroke="#241C15" stroke-width="0.6"/>
    <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="80" fill="none" stroke="#241C15" stroke-width="0.4"/>
    <g stroke="#241C15" stroke-width="0.5">
      <line x1="100" y1="2" x2="100" y2="198"/><line x1="2" y1="100" x2="198" y2="100"/>
      <line x1="30" y1="30" x2="170" y2="170"/><line x1="170" y1="30" x2="30" y2="170"/>
    </g>
    <path d="M100 20 L112 100 L100 180 L88 100 Z" fill="#241C15"/>
    <path d="M20 100 L100 88 L180 100 L100 112 Z" fill="#241C15" opacity="0.5"/>
  </svg>
  <div class="hero-lat">01°08'N — Ekspansi Kekuasaan Sejak Abad ke-15</div>
  <h1>Imperialisme<em>Ketika Bangsa Berlomba Menguasai Dunia</em></h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">Dari pelayaran mencari rempah hingga korporasi yang mendikte kebijakan negara berkembang — inilah kisah bagaimana kekuasaan diperluas jauh melampaui batas wilayah asalnya.</p>
  <div class="hero-etym">Dari bahasa Latin <b>imperare</b> — "memerintah, menguasai" — akar kata dari <b>imperium</b>, kekuasaan untuk memerintah.</div>
  <div class="scroll-cue">Gulir<div class="line"></div></div>
</header>

<section id="pengertian">
  <div class="section-head reveal">
    <span class="eyebrow">Definisi</span>
    <h2>Bukan Sekadar Menjajah Wilayah</h2>
    <p>Imperialisme adalah kebijakan sebuah negara besar untuk memperluas kendali dan kekuasaannya atas bangsa lain — secara militer, politik, maupun ekonomi — demi keuntungan negara penjajah itu sendiri.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap define-grid">
    <div class="define-text reveal">
      <p><strong>Secara etimologi</strong>, kata imperialisme berasal dari bahasa Latin <em>imperare</em> yang berarti memerintah atau menguasai. Kekuasaan untuk memerintah tersebut dinamakan <strong>imperium</strong> — akar dari kata yang kini kita kenal sebagai imperialisme.</p>
      <p>Secara umum, imperialisme dijalankan lewat penjajahan yang menyasar tiga ranah sekaligus: kendali <strong>militer</strong> untuk menundukkan perlawanan, kendali <strong>politik</strong> untuk mengatur pemerintahan lokal, dan kendali <strong>ekonomi</strong> untuk mengeksploitasi sumber daya wilayah jajahan. Semuanya bermuara pada satu tujuan: keuntungan bagi negara metropolis, negara pusat kekuasaan.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="compare-card reveal">
      <div class="compare-title">Imperialisme vs Kolonialisasi</div>
      <div class="compare-sub">Dua istilah yang sering tertukar</div>
      <div class="compare-row">
        <div><span class="label">Kolonialisasi</span><p>Fokus pada penguasaan wilayah baru secara fisik dan pemindahan penduduk untuk mendirikan permukiman di bawah kendali negara asal.</p></div>
        <div><span class="label">Imperialisme</span><p>Fokus pada dominasi kekuasaan, pengaruh politik, dan penguasaan sumber daya ekonomi — bisa dilakukan tanpa menduduki wilayah secara permanen.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="jenis" style="background:var(--paper-deep);">
  <div class="section-head reveal">
    <span class="eyebrow">Klasifikasi</span>
    <h2>Dua Wajah Imperialisme</h2>
    <p>Berdasarkan waktu terjadinya, imperialisme terbagi menjadi dua era besar dengan motif dan cara kerja yang sangat berbeda.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="era-toggle reveal">
      <button class="active" data-era="kuno">Imperialisme Kuno</button>
      <button data-era="modern">Imperialisme Modern</button>
    </div>

    <div class="era-panel active" id="panel-kuno">
      <div class="era-layout">
        <div class="era-visual kuno">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" stroke="#ECE2C8" stroke-width="1.6">
            <path d="M20 80 Q20 40 50 30 Q80 40 80 80 Z"/>
            <path d="M50 30 L50 10" stroke-width="2"/>
            <path d="M50 10 L68 16 L50 22 Z" fill="#ECE2C8" stroke="none"/>
            <circle cx="50" cy="55" r="14" stroke-dasharray="2 3"/>
          </svg>
          <div class="era-year">Abad ke-15 — Abad ke-18</div>
        </div>
        <div class="era-copy">
          <span class="eyebrow">Sebelum Revolusi Industri</span>
          <h3>Imperialisme Kuno</h3>
          <p>Berlangsung sebelum Revolusi Industri, imperialisme kuno digerakkan oleh tiga semboyan besar yang mendorong bangsa Eropa mengarungi samudra:</p>
          <div class="motto"><span>Gold</span><span>Gospel</span><span>Glory</span></div>
          <ul class="era-list">
            <li>Mencari kekayaan berupa rempah-rempah dan logam mulia</li>
            <li>Menyebarkan agama ke wilayah-wilayah baru</li>
            <li>Memperluas kejayaan dan kekuasaan imperium</li>
          </ul>
          <p style="margin-top:22px;"><strong>Contoh:</strong> penjelajahan samudra oleh bangsa Spanyol dan Portugis menuju Asia dan Amerika.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="era-panel" id="panel-modern">
      <div class="era-layout">
        <div class="era-visual modern">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" stroke="#ECE2C8" stroke-width="1.6">
            <rect x="25" y="45" width="12" height="35"/>
            <rect x="44" y="30" width="12" height="50"/>
            <rect x="63" y="55" width="12" height="25"/>
            <path d="M31 45 L31 30 M50 30 L50 15 M69 55 L69 40" stroke-width="2"/>
            <circle cx="31" cy="25" r="4" fill="#ECE2C8" stroke="none" opacity="0.7"/>
            <circle cx="50" cy="10" r="4" fill="#ECE2C8" stroke="none" opacity="0.7"/>
            <circle cx="69" cy="35" r="4" fill="#ECE2C8" stroke="none" opacity="0.7"/>
          </svg>
          <div class="era-year">Abad ke-19 — Awal Abad ke-20</div>
        </div>
        <div class="era-copy">
          <span class="eyebrow">Pasca Revolusi Industri</span>
          <h3>Imperialisme Modern</h3>
          <p>Didorong oleh kebutuhan ekonomi mendesak akibat kemajuan industri di Eropa, imperialisme modern mengubah wilayah jajahan menjadi mesin penopang pabrik-pabrik Eropa.</p>
          <ul class="era-list">
            <li>Mencari sumber bahan baku industri secara murah</li>
            <li>Membuka daerah dan pasar baru bagi hasil industri massal</li>
            <li>Menjadi tempat penanaman modal atas surplus kapital</li>
          </ul>
          <p style="margin-top:22px;"><strong>Contoh:</strong> penjajahan Inggris, Belanda, dan Prancis di Asia dan Afrika demi karet, minyak, batu bara, dan kapas.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="timeline reveal">
      <div class="timeline-track">
        <div class="timeline-pt"><div class="dot"></div><div class="yr">Abad 15–16</div><div class="desc">Pelayaran Spanyol & Portugis dimulai — perburuan 3G</div></div>
        <div class="timeline-pt"><div class="dot"></div><div class="yr">Abad 17–18</div><div class="desc">Puncak imperialisme kuno, monopoli dagang rempah</div></div>
        <div class="timeline-pt"><div class="dot"></div><div class="yr">Abad 19</div><div class="desc">Revolusi Industri memicu imperialisme modern</div></div>
        <div class="timeline-pt"><div class="dot"></div><div class="yr">Awal Abad 20</div><div class="desc">Ekspansi ekonomi & pasar global oleh kekuatan industri</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contoh">
  <div class="section-head reveal">
    <span class="eyebrow">Studi Kasus</span>
    <h2>Jejak Imperialisme dalam Sejarah</h2>
    <p>Tiga contoh nyata yang memperlihatkan bagaimana imperialisme dijalankan dengan cara berbeda-beda di berbagai belahan dunia.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap case-grid">

    <div class="case reveal">
      <div class="case-flag uk"><span class="yrs">Abad 18 — 19</span></div>
      <div class="case-body">
        <span class="kicker">Asia Selatan</span>
        <h4>Imperialisme Inggris di India</h4>
        <p>Melalui perusahaan dagang <strong>British East India Company (EIC)</strong>, Inggris secara perlahan menguasai sistem politik, ekonomi, dan pemerintahan India sejak abad ke-18, hingga resmi menjadi koloni Imperium Britania (<em>British Raj</em>) pada abad ke-19. India dijadikan pemasok bahan baku kapas sekaligus pasar bagi produk tekstil pabrik Inggris.</p>
        <div class="case-tags"><span>EIC</span><span>British Raj</span><span>Tekstil & Kapas</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="case reveal">
      <div class="case-flag nl"><span class="yrs">Abad 17 — 19</span></div>
      <div class="case-body">
        <span class="kicker">Nusantara</span>
        <h4>Imperialisme Belanda di Indonesia</h4>
        <p>Berawal dari monopoli perdagangan rempah-rempah oleh <strong>VOC</strong> pada abad ke-17, kekuasaan Belanda berubah menjadi penguasaan teritorial penuh oleh Pemerintah Kerajaan Belanda pada abad ke-19 — melalui sistem <strong>tanam paksa (cultuurstelsel)</strong> dan eksploitasi ekonomi besar-besaran.</p>
        <div class="case-tags"><span>VOC</span><span>Cultuurstelsel</span><span>Monopoli Rempah</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="case reveal">
      <div class="case-flag us"><span class="yrs">Akhir Abad 19 — 20</span></div>
      <div class="case-body">
        <span class="kicker">Amerika Latin & Pasifik</span>
        <h4>Imperialisme Amerika Serikat</h4>
        <p>Lewat <strong>Kebijakan Pintu Terbuka (Open Door Policy)</strong>, Amerika Serikat menampilkan wajah imperialisme modern: tidak selalu mencaplok wilayah secara militer, melainkan mendominasi perekonomian, pasar, dan kebijakan politik negara berkembang demi kepentingan modal korporasi — sering disebut <em>imperialisme ekonomi</em>.</p>
        <div class="case-tags"><span>Open Door Policy</span><span>Imperialisme Ekonomi</span><span>Dominasi Pasar</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

